  npc2Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 761a5c1245ed4c341a6c6e4c882e5b24, type: 3}
  npc2TalkingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 761a5c1245ed4c341a6c6e4c882e5b24, type: 3}
  npc2ThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 761a5c1245ed4c341a6c6e4c882e5b24, type: 3}
  npc2SmilingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 761a5c1245ed4c341a6c6e4c882e5b24, type: 3}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e0335f54812715e4fae89a21cfb8f37f, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 2
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Di dekat vending machine, kamu mendengar dua rekan kerja sedang berbicara
      pelan.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Serius, komputer pribadi kamu kena hack?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8f4d67720db2a742aa2384cfb4dbb92, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 3
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Iya. Semalam lagi browsing, tiba-tiba muncul pop up bilang PC-ku terinfeksi
      dan harus klik untuk memperbaiki.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c11023f380c2c3047b0808ee70230041, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Terus kamu klik?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 220ce558913a0cf488f0ecd382193926, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 3
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Aku panik. Aku klik Scan Now, lalu diminta install aplikasi kecil. Setelah
      itu browser penuh iklan aneh.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85c2c20bd9ed8d6428bb229e5e00d248, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Itu jebakan. Pop up seperti itu sering cuma menakut-nakuti supaya orang
      install malware.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54a5d8828cf97dd4d83949f550a45a80, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 3
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Iya, sekarang beberapa fileku berubah dan laptop jadi lambat banget.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2d8164cc6a8f1d448b7e5db4afa149a, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Lain kali tutup tabnya, jangan download apa pun, dan cek lewat antivirus
      resmi atau minta bantuan IT.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a71e8514fdd7ff945926aa7e4544757c, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 2
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: 'Kamu mendapat petunjuk penting: jangan percaya pop up acak, jangan install
      aplikasi dari peringatan browser yang tidak jelas, lalu kembali ke meja.'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 3
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Oke, cukup jelas. Saatnya balik ke meja dan mulai browsing dengan aman.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a62da25bccce2cf45abae6eedf185218, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2aa61b2594fe5c24880c182caba02bf3, type: 3}
  hasChoice: 0
  acceptText: Ya
  rejectText: Tidak
  dialogueIfAccepted: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueIfRejected: {fileID: 0}
  actionID: VN_Topic4_Vending_Overheard
